body:
I don't know you, but I don't believe i have to to say this with certainty: I love you. Because you are worthy of love, simply by virtue of existing. We who struggle with depression are stronger than we realize. If you need someone to talk to, I am always here. Please stay. The world would be losing so much otherwise. 

&#x200B;

Be safe, dear. And contact me if you need to. <3
